{"content":[{"c":["MAASEIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":[" 1. One of the singers appointed by the Levites to accompany David when he brought the ark from Obed-edom’s house to Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.15.18-20","r":"1Chr.15.18-20","rawR":"1Chr.15.18-20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.15.18-20","value":"1Chr.15.18-20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 15:18-20"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 2. Commander who agreed to assist Jehoiada the priest in crowning Joash king (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.23.1","r":"2Chr.23.1","rawR":"2Chr.23.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.23.1","value":"2Chr.23.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 23:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 3. Officer who served King Uzziah by assisting in the organization of the king’s army (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.26.11","r":"2Chr.26.11","rawR":"2Chr.26.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.26.11","value":"2Chr.26.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 26:11"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 4. Son of Judah’s royal house who was slain when Pekah the king of Israel invaded Judah (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.28.7","r":"2Chr.28.7","rawR":"2Chr.28.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.28.7","value":"2Chr.28.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 28:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 5. Ruler in Jerusalem whom Josiah appointed to assist in repairing the temple (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.34.8","r":"2Chr.34.8","rawR":"2Chr.34.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.34.8","value":"2Chr.34.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 34:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 6–8. Three priests who obeyed Ezra’s exhortation to divorce their foreign wives during the postexilic era (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.18-22","r":"Ezra.10.18-22","rawR":"Ezra.10.18-22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.18-22","value":"Ezra.10.18-22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:18-22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 9. Pahath-moab’s son (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.30","r":"Ezra.10.30","rawR":"Ezra.10.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.30","value":"Ezra.10.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:30"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["10. Father of Azariah, a repairman of the Jerusalem wall (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.23","r":"Neh.3.23","rawR":"Neh.3.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.23","value":"Neh.3.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["11. Ezra’s attendant when he read the law to the people (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.8.4","r":"Neh.8.4","rawR":"Neh.8.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.8.4","value":"Neh.8.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 8:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["12. Levite who, with others, helped the people to understand the law Ezra read (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.8.7","r":"Neh.8.7","rawR":"Neh.8.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.8.7","value":"Neh.8.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 8:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["13. Leader who set his seal on Ezra’s covenant under Nehemiah’s leadership (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.25","r":"Neh.10.25","rawR":"Neh.10.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.25","value":"Neh.10.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:25"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["14. Judahite leader and the son of Baruch, who lived in Jerusalem with those chosen by lot to inherit the rebuilt city (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.5","r":"Neh.11.5","rawR":"Neh.11.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.5","value":"Neh.11.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:5"},"). He is sometimes identified with the Asaiah mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.5","r":"1Chr.9.5","rawR":"1Chr.9.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.5","value":"1Chr.9.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 9:5"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["15. Ithiel’s son from Benjamin’s tribe who was chosen to live in Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.7","r":"Neh.11.7","rawR":"Neh.11.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.7","value":"Neh.11.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["16. Priestly trumpeter at the dedication of the Jerusalem wall (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.41","r":"Neh.12.41","rawR":"Neh.12.41","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.41","value":"Neh.12.41"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:41"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["17. Priestly singer at the dedication of the Jerusalem wall (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.42","r":"Neh.12.42","rawR":"Neh.12.42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.42","value":"Neh.12.42"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:42"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["18. Father of Zephaniah the priest. Zephaniah, with Pashhur, was sent to Jeremiah by King Zedekiah to inquire of the Lord concerning the future of Nebuchadnezzar’s war against Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.21.1-2","r":"Jer.21.1-2","rawR":"Jer.21.1-2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.21.1-2","value":"Jer.21.1-2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 21:1-2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.29.25","r":"Jer.29.25","rawR":"Jer.29.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.29.25","value":"Jer.29.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"29:25"},") and to request that Jeremiah pray for Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.37.3","r":"Jer.37.3","rawR":"Jer.37.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.37.3","value":"Jer.37.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"37:3"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["19. Father of Zedekiah the false prophet, an opponent of Jeremiah’s prophecy about Jerusalem’s fall under Nebuchadnezzar’s siege (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.29.21","r":"Jer.29.21","rawR":"Jer.29.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.29.21","value":"Jer.29.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 29:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["20. KJV form of Mahseiah, Baruch’s forefather, in ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.32.12","r":"Jer.32.12","rawR":"Jer.32.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.32.12","value":"Jer.32.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jeremiah 32:12"}," and ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.51.59","r":"Jer.51.59","rawR":"Jer.51.59","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.51.59","value":"Jer.51.59"}],"t":"ref","v":"51:59"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Mahseiah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Mahseiah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Mahseiah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Mahseiah"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["21. Keeper of the threshold during Jehoiakim’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.35.4","r":"Jer.35.4","rawR":"Jer.35.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.35.4","value":"Jer.35.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 35:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Maaseiah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 15:18-20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.15.18-20","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.15.18-20","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.15.18-20"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 23:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.23.1","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.23.1","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.23.1"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 26:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.26.11","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.26.11","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.26.11"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 28:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.28.7","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.28.7","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.28.7"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 34:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.34.8","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.34.8","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.34.8"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:18-22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.18-22","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.18-22","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.18-22"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.30","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.30","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.30"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.23","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.23","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.23"},{"anchorText":"Neh 8:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.8.4","rawQueryValue":"Neh.8.4","sourceRefExact"